<title>INDIA: India McDowell sells polymer unit to LG.</title>
<headline>India McDowell sells polymer unit to LG.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian liquor brewer McDowell and Co Ltd has sold its polymer division to South Korea's LG Chemical Ltd  39000.KS), its chairman said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;A sale-purchase agreement has been signed with LG Chemical,&quot; its chairman Vijay Mallya told Reuters in New Delhi.</p>
<p>&quot;The total deal value will be in excess of 1.25 billion rupees,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>After the sale of the division, McDowell would retain to its brewing and distillate units, Mallya said. $1=35.6 rupees</p>
<p>--Narayanan Madhavan, New Delhi newsroom 91-11-301 2024</p>
</text>
